OL,3,GNEWSACity of Culture judge praises
OL,4,AMilton Keynes roundabouts
OL,5,
OL,6,FJudges assessing Milton Keynes' bid for
OL,7,FCity of Culture status have praised its
OL,8,Funique road layout and local enthusiasm
OL,9,Fduring an official visit.
OL,11,FTelevision producer Sir Philip Redmond,
OL,12,Fwho created Grange Hill, Brookside and
OL,13,FHollyoaks, joked that Milton Keynes was
OL,14,F"out there in front, as the first one
OL,15,Fwe've been to".
OL,17,FSir Philip and the other judges toured
OL,18,Fthe city on Tuesday. Three other UK
OL,19,Flocations are competing for the title,
OL,20,Fwith the winner receiving a #10m
OL,21,Finvestment.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
